[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9661.59, "timestamp": "02:41:01", "text": "好了，我们开始吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9666.71, "timestamp": "02:41:06", "text": "完美的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9669.349, "timestamp": "02:41:09", "text": "接受圣化。攻击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9670.63, "timestamp": "02:41:10", "text": "攻击。 [音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9673.2, "timestamp": "02:41:13", "text": "[音乐] 好的。损害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9684.79, "timestamp": "02:41:24", "text": "好的。这团黏液如今已与神合而为一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9689.51, "timestamp": "02:41:29", "text": "好的。好的。但从这里开始，我将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9692.07, "timestamp": "02:41:32", "text": "实际上，我们应该掌握主动权。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9694.07, "timestamp": "02:41:34", "text": "如果你愿意的话，以后可以重新抽取，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9697.75, "timestamp": "02:41:37", "text": "会保持主动权，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9701.67, "timestamp": "02:41:41", "text": "呃，这边，呃，一旦你……呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9704.469, "timestamp": "02:41:44", "text": "像你们所有人一样，把黏液清除掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9714.389, "timestamp": "02:41:54", "text": "你也喜欢移动你所……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9716.309, "timestamp": "02:41:56", "text": "肌肉一直都像这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9718.87, "timestamp": "02:41:58", "text": "就像慢慢地把你拉进去一样。就像"}]